#heroMenuButton:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffe3a0;outline-offset:3px}
#optionsMenu #characterMenuSummary{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0 0 6px;font:13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#d9d0b9}
#optionsMenu #menuPage_character button{text-align:left;min-height:52px}
#portraitMenuHint{font:12px/1.5 system-ui;color:#c7cebd;margin:6px 0 12px}
</style>

<style id="portrait-layout-fix">
body:has(#gameView:not([hidden])) .shell .hudSide .stats{padding-left:62px;min-height:79px}
body .shell #heroMenuButton{box-sizing:border-box;width:50px;height:67px;left:4px;top:4px}
#optionsMenu .cleanMenuPage{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
#optionsMenu #menuPage_character>button{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:0;min-height:58px;margin:0;padding:10px;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;align-self:stretch}
#optionsMenu #menuPage_character .menuHint{display:block;margin-top:5px;font:12px/1.4 system-ui}
#optionsMenu .optionsDone{position:static;box-shadow:none;margin-top:12px}
#optionsMenu{scroll-padding-block:12px}
@media(max-width:360px){#optionsMenu .cleanMenuPage{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
</style>
<style>.shopGearRequirements{margin:6px 0;color:#c5e7b3;font:13px/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:normal}.shopGearRequirements.restricted{color:#ffb9a6}</style></head>
<body><section id="titleMenu" aria-label="Thornhaven main menu" hidden><canvas id="titleMap" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div class="titleContent"><header class="titlePlaque"><h1>THORNHAVEN</h1><p>NEW JOURNEY</p></header><nav class="titleButtons" aria-label="Main menu"><button id="titleNew" type="button">Start New Game<small>Begin a new character</small></button><button id="titleContinue" type="button">Continue Game<small>Return to your last adventure</small></button><button id="titleCharacters" type="button">Characters<small>Choose a saved journey</small></button><button id="titleDisplay" type="button">Display<small>Fullscreen and screen orientation</small></button><button id="titleSettings" type="button">Settings<small>Sound and movement controls</small></button></nav><p id="titleSaveInfo" role="status"></p><p class="titleVersion">Version 1.0.43 · Ashvale Reach</p></div></section><div id="assetLoading" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;padding:24px;background:#111d18;color:#f2dfb3;font:18px Georgia"><p>Preparing Ashvale…</p><button hidden type="button" style="min-height:44px;padding:10px 24px">Try again</button></div>
<section id="summonsScreen" hidden aria-label="An unsigned summons"><div class="summonsContent"><h1>THORNHAVEN</h1><p>An unsigned letter arrives before dusk.</p><blockquote>“The kingdom is in danger. Come to the camp beside the old road at dusk. Tell no one. If you still believe this land is worth saving, I need your help.”</blockquote><p>There is no name. Only a location: <strong>Wayfarer’s Camp.</strong><br>You take the road before nightfall.</p><button id="summonsContinue" type="button">Tap to Continue</button></div></section><main class="shell">
<header class="top"><div class="brand">THORNHAVEN <small>Ashvale Reach · New Journey · v1.0.43 · The Reach lives on</small></div><div class="status"><span class="pill">◆ <b id="mapName">Ashvale Reach</b></span><span class="pill" id="itemPill" hidden>✦ Ember Rune</span><span class="pill" id="keystonePill" hidden>✥ Fourfold Keystone</span><span class="pill">✦ Level <b id="level">1</b></span><span class="pill">◈ <b id="coins">12</b> crowns</span><span class="pill autosavePill">Autosaved locally</span><button class="optionsToggle" id="optionsToggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="optionsMenu">☰ MENU</button></div></header>
<div class="optionsMenu" id="optionsMenu" role="dialog" aria-label="Game options" hidden><div class="optionsCard"><div class="optionsTitle">ADVENTURE MENU</div><p style="font:11px system-ui;color:#d8c99f">Ashvale Reach · Single player</p><div id="quickMenuLinks"></div><div class="optionsLabel">Screen orientation</div><div class="orientationChoices" role="group" aria-label="Screen orientation"><button type="button" data-orientation="portrait">Portrait</button><button type="button" data-orientation="landscape">Landscape</button><button type="button" data-orientation="auto">Auto-rotate</button></div><div class="optionsLabel">Movement</div><div class="sideChoices"><button type="button" data-movement-choice="touch" aria-pressed="true">Touch to move</button><button type="button" data-movement-choice="arrows" aria-pressed="false">Joystick</button></div><p style="font:11px system-ui">Tap a destination to walk there. Hold and drag to steer; release to stop. Tap near your hero to stop walking.</p><div class="optionsLabel">Controls side</div><div class="sideChoices"><button type="button" data-side-choice="left" aria-pressed="false">Left</button><button type="button" data-side-choice="right" aria-pressed="true">Right</button></div><button type="button" id="frontierChapterButton">A HEARTH WORTH KEEPING</button><button type="button" id="settlementButton">YOUR SETTLEMENT</button><button type="button" id="storyChronicleButton">STORY CHRONICLE</button><button type="button" id="fieldGuideButton">HOW TO PLAY</button><button type="button" id="fullscreenToggle">FULL SCREEN</button><button type="button" id="soundToggle" aria-pressed="true">SOUND EFFECTS: ON</button><button type="button" id="premiumShopButton">PREMIUM SHOP · PREVIEW</button><button type="button" id="saveFilesButton">CHARACTER SAVES</button><button type="button" id="closeGameButton">CLOSE GAME</button><fieldset id="danTestControls" hidden><legend>TheDanCode · Uncapped level testing</legend><span id="danCodeStatus" role="status" style="grid-column:1/-1"></span><button type="button" id="danRefill" style="grid-column:1/-1">START AT LEAST LEVEL 100</button><button type="button" id="danLevelOne">+1 LEVEL</button><button type="button" id="danLevelTen">+10 LEVELS</button><label for="danTestClass">Class</label><select id="danTestClass"><option value="warrior">Warrior</option><option value="rogue">Rogue</option><option value="mage">Mage</option><option value="cleric">Cleric</option></select><label for="danTestGender">Gender</label><select id="danTestGender"><option value="male">Male</option><option value="female">Female</option></select></fieldset><button class="optionsDone" id="optionsDone" type="button">Done</button></div></div>
<section class="setup" id="characterSetup" aria-label="Create your character"><div class="openingCreate"><span class="openingEyebrow">YOUR STORY BEGINS HERE</span><h1>Choose your hero</h1><p class="openingIntro">Every legend begins with a name.</p><form id="characterForm"><label class="nameLabel" for="characterName">Character name</label><input id="characterName" type="text" maxlength="16" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter a name" required><fieldset class="genderChoices"><legend>Choose gender</legend><div class="genderGrid"><label class="genderPick"><input type="radio" name="heroGender" value="male" checked><span>Male</span></label><label class="genderPick"><input type="radio" name="heroGender" value="female"><span>Female</span></label></div><p class="genderNote">Changes appearance. Class skills and stats stay the same.</p></fieldset><label class="nameLabel">Choose a class</label><div class="classGrid"><label class="classPick"><input type="radio" name="heroClass" value="warrior" checked><div class="classCard"><b>Warrior</b><span>High vitality and powerful close-range strikes.<br><i>Begins at Wayfarer’s Camp.</i></span></div></label><label class="classPick"><input type="radio" name="heroClass" value="rogue"><div class="classCard"><b>Rogue</b><span>Fast movement and quick attacks.<br><i>Begins at Wayfarer’s Camp.</i></span></div></label><label class="classPick"><input type="radio" name="heroClass" value="mage"><div class="classCard"><b>Mage</b><span>Lower vitality, but long-range magic attacks.<br><i>Begins at Wayfarer’s Camp.</i></span></div></label><label class="classPick"><input type="radio" name="heroClass" value="cleric"><div class="classCard"><b>Cleric</b><span>Steady vitality and healing after defeating foes.<br><i>Begins at Wayfarer’s Camp.</i></span></div></label></div><button class="startButton" type="submit">Begin Journey</button></form><button type="button" id="setupSaveFilesButton" class="setupSaveButton">Continue a saved adventure</button><p class="openingSaveNote">Progress saves automatically on this device.</p></div></section>
<section class="game" id="gameView" aria-label="Thornhaven game" hidden>
<canvas id="world" width="960" height="600" aria-label="Top-down fantasy RPG game world"></canvas>
<div class="hud">
<div class="card quest"><div class="questTitleRow"><h2 id="questTitle">First Hunt</h2><div class="questButtons"><button type="button" class="journalButton" id="worldButton">MAPS</button><button type="button" class="journalButton" id="journalButton">QUEST LOG</button></div></div><p id="quest"><span id="questDetails">Clear three ash slimes near the old road.</span> <b id="progress">0 / 3</b></p></div>
<div class="hudSide"><div class="card stats"><button id="heroMenuButton" type="button" aria-label="Open character menu" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="optionsMenu" aria-expanded="false" title="Character menu"><canvas id="heroHudPortrait" width="100" height="134" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span>HERO</span></button><div><b id="heroName">Hero</b> · <span id="className">Warrior</span></div><div>VITALITY <b id="hpText">100 / 100</b></div><div class="bar"><div id="hp" class="fill"></div></div><div>EXPERIENCE <b id="xpText">0 / 40</b></div><div class="bar" style="height:4px;background:#363327"><div id="xp" class="xpbar"></div></div></div><div class="zoomControls" role="group" aria-label="World camera zoom"><button type="button" id="zoomOut" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button type="button" id="zoomReset" aria-label="Reset zoom to 100 percent">100%</button><button type="button" id="zoomIn" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button></div></div>



</div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div></section>
<div class="screenShade" id="inventoryScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventoryTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel inventoryPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="inventoryTitle">Pack &amp; Equipment</h2><p id="inventorySummary">Hero · Warrior</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="inventoryScreen" aria-label="Close inventory">×</button></header><nav class="screenTabs inventoryTabs" aria-label="Inventory categories"><button type="button" data-inventory-tab="all" aria-pressed="true">◉ Pack</button><button type="button" data-inventory-tab="consumable" aria-pressed="false">✚ Supplies</button><button type="button" data-inventory-tab="gear" aria-pressed="false">⚔ Gear</button><button type="button" data-inventory-tab="quest" aria-pressed="false">✧ Quest</button><button type="button" data-inventory-tab="gathering" aria-pressed="false">⚒ Gathering</button></nav><div class="inventoryMeta"><span id="inventoryWallet">◈ 0 crowns</span><span id="bagCapacity">0 / 24 items</span><span id="equipmentSummary" hidden></span></div><div class="inventoryLayout"><aside class="inventoryHero"><div class="inventoryHeroTitle">EQUIPPED</div><div class="inventoryVitals"><strong id="inventoryHeroName">Hero</strong><span id="inventoryHeroClass">Warrior · Level 1</span><div class="inventoryVital"><span>Vitality</span><b id="inventoryVitality">100 / 100</b></div><div class="inventoryVitalBar"><i id="inventoryVitalBar"></i></div><div class="inventoryAttack"><span>Attack</span><b id="inventoryAttack">1</b></div><div class="inventoryAttack"><span>Guard</span><b id="inventoryGuard">0</b></div></div><div id="inventoryGearSlots" class="inventoryGearSlots"></div><p id="inventorySetBonuses" class="setBonusSummary"></p></aside><section class="inventoryPack"><header class="inventoryPackHead"><strong>YOUR BAG</strong><span>Tap an item to inspect it</span></header><div class="itemGrid" id="inventoryList"></div></section></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span id="inventoryNotice" aria-live="polite">Select an item for its details and actions.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="inventoryScreen">Close</button></footer><div class="itemDetailShade" id="itemDetailShade" hidden><section class="itemDetailCard" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="itemDetailName"><header class="itemDetailHead"><h3 id="itemDetailName">Item</h3><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-item-detail aria-label="Close item details">×</button></header><div class="itemDetailBody"><div id="itemDetailIcon" class="itemDetailIcon">✦</div><div class="itemDetailInfo"><div id="itemDetailType" class="itemDetailType"></div><div id="itemDetailStats" class="itemDetailStats"></div><p id="itemDetailDescription"></p></div></div><div id="itemDetailActions" class="itemDetailActions"></div></section></div></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="travelScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="travelTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel worldPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="travelTitle">World Map</h2><p>16 places · tap a marker to travel</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="travelScreen" aria-label="Close world map">×</button></header><div class="screenMeta"><span id="travelCurrent">Current location: Ashvale Reach</span><span>◇ Town · ⚔ Hunting ground · ✧ Shrine</span></div><div id="travelDestinations" class="travelDestinations"></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span>Locked places open as your adventure progresses.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="travelScreen">Return to game</button></footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="characterScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="characterScreenTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel characterPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="characterScreenTitle">Character</h2><p>Equipped gear and combat stats</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-character-action="close" aria-label="Close character screen">×</button></header><div class="characterSummary"><div><strong id="characterSheetName">Hero</strong><span id="characterSheetClass">Warrior · Level 1</span></div><div id="characterSheetStats">Vitality 100 · Attack 1 · Guard 0</div></div><div class="screenNotice" id="characterNotice" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="buildChoices" class="buildChoices"></div><div class="gearLayout"><section class="gearSlots" id="gearSlots" aria-label="Equipped gear slots"></section><section class="characterGear"><h3>GEAR IN YOUR BAG</h3><div class="itemList" id="characterGearList"></div></section></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span>Choose gear from your bag to equip it.</span><div class="partyMemberActions"><button type="button" data-character-action="settlement">Settlement</button><button type="button" data-character-action="skills">Gathering Skills</button><button type="button" data-character-action="party">Manage Pets</button><button type="button" data-character-action="close">Close</button></div></footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="skillsScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="skillsTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel skillsPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="skillsTitle">Gathering Skills</h2><p id="skillsSummary">Train by gathering resources in the world</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="skillsScreen" aria-label="Close gathering skills">×</button></header><div class="screenNotice">Buy a pick, hatchet, and fishing rod in any town shop. Gather near marked rocks, trees, and water. Skills and levels save with this character.</div><div id="gatheringSkillList" class="gatheringSkillList"></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span id="gatheringToolStatus">Tools let you work resource nodes.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="skillsScreen">Close</button></footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="partyScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="partyTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel partyPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="partyTitle">Traveling Party</h2><p>Bring up to three companions on the road</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="partyScreen" aria-label="Close party screen">×</button></header><div class="screenNotice" id="partyNotice" aria-live="polite">Recruit adventurers in town. Gear must be in your bag before you can equip it.</div><div class="partyLayout"><section class="partyRoster"><h3>YOUR COMPANIONS</h3><div id="partyMembers"></div></section><section class="partyGear"><h3 id="partyGearTitle">COMPANION EQUIPMENT</h3><div id="partyEquipmentSlots"></div><h3>GEAR IN YOUR BAG</h3><div class="itemList" id="partyGearList"></div></section></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span>Recruit up to three active companions; compatible gear comes from town shops.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="partyScreen">Close</button></footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="adventureScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="adventureTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel"><header class="screenHead"><h2 id="adventureTitle">Story</h2><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="adventureScreen" aria-label="Close story">×</button></header><div id="adventureText" style="padding:14px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#e7dfc9;overflow:auto"></div><div id="adventureChoices" class="adventureChoices"></div><footer class="screenFoot">Choices and progress save with this character.</footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="questScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="questJournalTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="questJournalTitle">Quest Journal</h2><p>Choose a quest to track while you explore</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="questScreen" aria-label="Close quest journal">×</button></header><div class="screenNotice">Tap Track quest to pin its objective above the map. Show on map marks the destination. Visit quest givers to accept quests and collect rewards.</div><div class="questList" id="questList" tabindex="0" aria-label="Unfinished quests"></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span>Your journey continues one lead at a time.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="questScreen">Close</button></footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="saveFilesScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="saveFilesTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="saveFilesTitle">Character Saves</h2><p>Choose a character or start a new adventure</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="saveFilesScreen" aria-label="Close character saves">×</button></header><div class="screenNotice" id="saveFilesNotice">Each slot keeps its own character and progress.</div><div class="saveSlotList" id="saveSlotList"></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span>Saved on this device.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="saveFilesScreen">Back</button></footer></section></div>
<!-- Full-screen screen rule: keep shop/menu screens outside .game and disable game input while open. -->
<div class="screenShade" id="storageScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="storageTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel storagePanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="storageTitle">House Storage</h2><p>Move items between your pack and this chest</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="storageScreen" aria-label="Close storage">×</button></header><div class="screenMeta"><span id="storageChestName">Storage Chest</span><span id="storageCapacity">0 / 24 items</span></div><div class="storageLayout"><section class="storageColumn"><h3>CHEST</h3><div class="itemList" id="storageChestList"></div></section><section class="storageColumn"><h3>YOUR PACK</h3><div class="itemList" id="storageBagList"></div></section></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span id="storageNotice" aria-live="polite">Store or take items one at a time.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="storageScreen">Close</button></footer></section></div>
<div class="screenShade" id="shopScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="shopTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel shopPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="shopTitle">Ashvale Market</h2><p id="shopSeller">Tilda the Trader</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-screen="shopScreen" aria-label="Close shop">×</button></header><div class="screenMeta"><span id="shopWallet">◈ 0 crowns</span><span>Items sell for half their purchase price.</span></div><nav class="screenTabs" aria-label="Shop sections"><button type="button" data-shop-tab="buy" aria-pressed="true">Buy</button><button type="button" data-shop-tab="sell" aria-pressed="false">Sell</button><button type="button" data-shop-tab="upgrade" aria-pressed="false" hidden>⚒ Upgrade</button><button type="button" data-shop-tab="sets" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Set crafting</button></nav><div class="screenNotice" id="shopNotice" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="bulkSellBar" class="bulkSellBar" aria-live="polite" hidden></div><div class="itemList" id="shopList"></div><footer class="screenFoot"><span>Prices are shown in crowns.</span><button type="button" data-close-screen="shopScreen">Leave shop</button></footer></section></div>
<div class="bottom" id="controlRow" hidden><div class="hint">Battle: the action button attacks enemies in range and switches to INTERACT otherwise. Use your class skill, and DODGE out of orange warning circles. Keyboard: Space attack, Q skill, Shift dodge. Touch and hold the ground to move; slide to steer and lift to stop. Enable the optional arrow pad in MENU → Movement. The camera follows you through larger open areas. Press <b>MAPS</b> for direct travel. Get close, then press <b>INTERACT</b> to talk, gather at marked trees, rocks, and water, or use objects. Open <b>CHAR → Gathering Skills</b> to review progress.</div><div class="touchBar">
<div class="controls" aria-label="Eight direction movement"><button type="button" class="northwest" data-key="DiagonalNW" aria-label="Move northwest">↖</button><button type="button" class="up" data-key="ArrowUp" aria-label="Move north">▲</button><button type="button" class="northeast" data-key="DiagonalNE" aria-label="Move northeast">↗</button><button type="button" class="left" data-key="ArrowLeft" aria-label="Move west">◀</button><button type="button" class="right" data-key="ArrowRight" aria-label="Move east">▶</button><button type="button" class="southwest" data-key="DiagonalSW" aria-label="Move southwest">↙</button><button type="button" class="down" data-key="ArrowDown" aria-label="Move south">▼</button><button type="button" class="southeast" data-key="DiagonalSE" aria-label="Move southeast">↘</button></div><div class="actions" aria-label="Game actions"><div class="combatActions" role="group" aria-label="Combat controls"><button class="attack" id="attack" type="button" aria-label="Attack nearby enemy or interact">INTERACT</button><button class="combatButton" id="skillButton" type="button">SKILL</button></div><div class="utilityActions" role="group" aria-label="Game menus"><button class="combatButton" id="dodgeButton" type="button">DODGE</button><button class="inventoryButton" id="inventoryButton" type="button" aria-label="Open inventory">BAG</button><button class="inventoryButton characterButton" id="characterButton" type="button" aria-label="Open character equipment">CHAR</button></div></div></div></div>
</main>
<div class="screenShade" id="premiumScreen" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="premiumTitle" hidden><section class="screenPanel premiumPanel"><header class="screenHead"><div><h2 id="premiumTitle">The Ember Boutique</h2><p>Make your journey your own</p></div><button type="button" class="screenClose" data-close-premium aria-label="Close premium shop">×</button></header><div class="premiumPreviewNotice">PREMIUM SHOP · Purchases are not available yet. Cosmetic styles have free 60-second previews. Level packs, XP boosts and builder contracts require a purchase and cannot be previewed. Earn permanent titles by playing.</div><nav class="screenTabs" aria-label="Store categories"><button type="button" data-premium-category="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="levels">Levels</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="xp">XP boosts</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="builder">Builders</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="aura">Auras</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="trail">Trails</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="title">Titles</button><button type="button" data-premium-category="bundle">Collections</button></nav><div class="premiumSummary" id="premiumSummary"></div><details class="earnedTitleSection"><summary>Titles earned through adventure</summary><div id="earnedTitleList"></div></details><div class="premiumList" id="premiumList"></div><footer class="screenFoot"><button type="button" id="forumShopButton">Forum shop ↗</button><button type="button" id="restorePurchasesButton">Restore purchases</button><button type="button" data-clear-premium>Clear previews</button><button type="button" data-close-premium>Back to game</button></footer></section></div>
<script src="purchase-delivery.js"></script>
<script>
function presentLoadError(){const box=document.getElementById('assetLoading');if(box){box.querySelector('p').textContent='The game artwork could not load. Check your connection and try again.';box.querySelector('button').hidden=false;box.querySelector('button').onclick=()=>location.reload();}}
async function loadGameArtwork(){const response=await fetch('assets/artwork-2ebfe5ac.txt',{cache:'force-cache'});if(!response.ok)throw new Error('Artwork unavailable');const source=await response.text();const images=source.match(/data:image\/[^\s"']+/g)||[];if(images.length!==52)throw new Error('Incomplete artwork');return images;}
